QA Sentinels APT package
========================

This package provides the QA Sentinels CLI and a read-only seed tree under
/usr/share/qa-sentinels. The /usr/bin/qa wrapper:

  * uses an existing ~/QA-Sentinels checkout unchanged;
  * otherwise copies the seed to ~/QA-Sentinels on first use and runs
    `qa init`;
  * never overwrites a non-empty ~/QA-Sentinels directory that lacks bin/qa.

The own-product license and legal register is available with `qa legal`
(add `--json` for automation and `--check` for release checks).

The package does not install cron or systemd schedules automatically. Use:

  qa install-cron

or let QA Dashboard manage its fallback cycle. Layer 2/root helpers remain
available in the source checkout and are intentionally not installed by the
package.

Ubuntu series
-------------

Ubuntu 26.10 (stonking) packages are published as an untested preview. No
runtime testing on 26.10 is planned in the near term. Use Ubuntu 22.04,
24.04, or 26.04 for tested deployments.
